        "@value": "27 member states. The United Kingdom left the Union in 2020 and is dalicc:GB, which keeps some of the same law and has diverged in others."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#FromConvention",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept",
      "https://dalicc.net/ns#StatementOrigin"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The statement is a library convention applied to every record of its kind, not a sentence of the license text."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "From a library convention"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#FromText"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#convention"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#statementOrigin"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Added with version 2 of the vocabulary, so that a record can say which of its statements the text makes and which the library adds by convention."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "fromConvention"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#FromDefaultRule",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept",
      "https://dalicc.net/ns#StatementOrigin"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The statement was derived, for an action the license is silent on, by a\ndalicc:DefaultRule of the dependency graph the check ran under. The rule that produced it is\nnamed beside it."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "From a default rule"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#DefaultRule"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#FromText"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "fromDefaultRule"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#FromText",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept",
      "https://dalicc.net/ns#StatementOrigin"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The statement is modelled from a sentence of the license text. A statement node of a curated record that names no origin is read as this one."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "From the text"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#FromDefaultRule"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#statementOrigin"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "fromText"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#GB",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept",
      "https://dalicc.net/ns#Jurisdiction"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland, which kept the database right and the mining exception it had as a member state and has diverged since."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "United Kingdom"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "http://creativecommons.org/ns#jurisdiction"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#EU"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#member": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.bpiresearch.com/BPMO/2004/03/03/cdl/Countries#UnitedKingdom"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "GB"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#GrantedByDefault",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept",
      "https://dalicc.net/ns#DefaultOutcome"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The action is permitted unless the license prohibits it, for example because a\nstatutory exception allows it whatever the license says. A check under a graph that adopts the\nrule reads the silence as a permission and marks the finding as coming from the rule."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Granted by default"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#NotGrantedByDefault"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#NotWaivable"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "grantedByDefault"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#Hardware",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class",
      "https://dalicc.net/ns#AssetType"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/licenselibrary/CERN-OHL-S-2.0"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A physical product, or the design material from which one is made: schematics,\nlayouts, mechanical drawings, bills of material and the firmware that belongs to them. The open\nhardware licenses govern the design material and reach the product made from it."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Hardware"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Software"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#CreativeWork"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Used as a value of dct:type on the odrl:AssetCollection that an odrl:Set targets, alongside dcmitype:Software, dcmitype:Dataset and dalicc:CreativeWork. Carried by the three CERN Open Hardware Licence records."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#IN",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
