        "@value": "Added by the license library review of 2026-09-15, which recorded the clause as a vocabulary gap. Applied to 2 license records by the standard-license addition of 2026-09-15."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#attachoffer",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept",
      "http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/Action",
      "https://dalicc.net/ns#RuleAction"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.github.io/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Attaching to the work a written offer of further permissions."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Attach offer"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#addStatement"
      },
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#chargeOffer"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Assignee may add a written offer for permissions according to the license."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Defined in the 2022 documentation; not used by any license in the current library."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#attributionNotice",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept",
      "http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/Action",
      "https://dalicc.net/ns#DutyAction"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/isReplacedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://creativecommons.org/ns#Attribution"
      }
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.github.io/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Deprecated; replaced by cc:Attribution, because the library states attribution duties with it. Giving notice of the attributions that the licensed material carries."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://dalicc.net/ns#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
